{"type":"message","id":"8b49b125","parentId":"d7933310","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:58:56.025Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bb754b254523462b9e38be7b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FSRS-Memory 重构报告\n\n## 📊 项目概述\n\n**重构目标**: 将 fsrs-memory 重构为功能完善、界面美观的 WEB 版 ANKI 应用\n\n**项目位置**: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory`\n\n**开始日期**: 2026-02-27\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已完成工作\n\n### Phase 1: APKG 导入功能 (100% 完成)\n\n#### 1. 核心功能实现\n\n**APKG 解析模块** (`src/apkg-import.js`)\n- ✅ 使用 adm-zip 解析 APKG 文件（ZIP 格式）\n- ✅ 提取 SQLite 数据库中的卡片数据\n- ✅ 支持 Anki 多字段模型映射\n- ✅ 保留卡片学习状态（new/learning/review）\n- ✅ 提供预览和导入两个 API 方法\n\n**后端 API** (`web/server.js`)\n- ✅ `POST /api/apkg/preview` - 预览卡包内容\n- ✅ `POST /api/apkg/import` - 导入卡包到指定牌组\n- ✅ Multer 文件上传处理\n- ✅ 临时文件自动清理\n\n**前端界面** (`web/public/`)\n- ✅ 导入视图（`#import-view`）\n- ✅ 文件选择器（支持 .apkg）\n- ✅ 卡包预览（卡片数、牌组数、模型数）\n- ✅ 导入进度显示\n- ✅ 成功/错误结果展示\n- ✅ 导航菜单导入按钮\n\n#### 2. 测试验证\n\n**测试文件**: `/home/one/projects/chinese_medicine.apkg`\n\n**测试结果**:\n```\n✅ 预览成功\n   - 卡片数：286 张\n   - 牌组：2 个（Default, 中药学）\n   - 模型：1 个（中药学，字段：中药、功效）\n\n✅ 导入成功\n   - 导入数量：286 张\n   - 跳过数量：0 张\n   - 用时：~2 秒\n   - 目标牌组：默认牌组\n```\n\n**当前数据库状态**:\n- 总卡片数：581 张（原有 295 + 新导入 286）\n- 待复习：573 张\n\n#### 3. 技术细节\n\n**APKG 文件格式解析**:\n```\nAPKG (ZIP)\n├── collection.anki2 (SQLite)\n│   ├── notes (笔记表)\n│   │   ├── flds (字段值，\\x1f 分隔)\n│   │   └── sfld (排序字段)\n│   ├── cards (卡片表)\n│   │   ├── type (0=new, 1=learning, 2=review)\n│   │   ├── due (到期时间)\n│   │   └── ivl (间隔)\n│   └── col (集合表)\n│       ├── models (卡片模型)\n│       └── decks (牌组信息)\n└── media (媒体文件)\n```\n\n**字段映射**:\n- Anki 字段 1 → 问题（Question）\n- Anki 字段 2 → 答案（Answer）\n- 保留字段名称显示（如\"中药\"、\"功效\"）\n\n**状态映射**:\n- Anki `type=0` → FSRS `state='new'`\n- Anki `type=1` → FSRS `state='learning'`\n- Anki `type=2` → FSRS `state='review'`\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: UI 重构 (部分完成)\n\n#### 已完成:\n- ✅ 创建现代化 UI 原型 (`index-v2.html`)\n- ✅ 集成 Tailwind CSS CDN\n- ✅ 集成 Phosphor Icons 图标库\n- ✅ 卡片翻转动画 CSS\n- ✅ 暗色模式支持\n\n#### 待完成:\n- ⏳ 完整迁移所有视图（卡片、牌组、统计）\n- ⏳ 响应式布局优化\n- ⏳ 快捷键支持（1-5 评分）\n- ⏳ 学习进度可视化\n\n---\n\n## 📁 文件变更清单\n\n### 新增文件\n```\nsrc/\n  └── apkg-import.js        # APKG 导入模块（220 行）\n\nweb/\n  ├── uploads/              # 临时上传目录\n  └── public/\n      └── index-v2.html     # 现代化 UI 原型\n\nREFACTOR_PLAN.md            # 重构计划文档\nPHASE1_COMPLETE.md          # Phase 1 完成报告\nREFACTOR_REPORT.md          # 本文档\n```\n\n### 修改文件\n```\nweb/\n  ├── server.js             # +100 行（APKG API）\n  ├── public/\n  │   ├── index.html        # +80 行（导入视图）\n  │   ├── app.js            # +150 行（导入逻辑）\n  │   └── styles.css        # +200 行（导入样式）\n\npackage.json                # +multer 依赖\n```\n\n### 依赖更新\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"adm-zip\": \"^0.5.16\",         // 已有\n    \"better-sqlite3\": \"^12.6.2\",  // 已有\n    \"fsrs.js\": \"^1.2.2\",          // 已有\n    \"ts-fsrs\": \"^5.2.3\",          // 已有\n    \"multer\": \"^1.4.5-lts.1\",     // 新增\n    \"apkg-reader\": \"^1.1.0\"       // 新增（备用）\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 重构目标完成度\n\n| 目标 | 状态 | 完成度 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| 引入开源 FSRS 实现 | ✅ 已完成 | 100% |\n| 支持 ANKI 卡包导入 | ✅ 已完成 | 100% |\n| 专注 WEB 功能和美化 | 🔄 进行中 | 40% |\n| 可切换技术路线 | ✅ 已验证 | 100% |\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 技术栈评估\n\n### 当前技术栈（推荐保持）\n```\n后端：Express.js + better-sqlite3 + ts-fsrs\n前端：原生 HTML/CSS/JavaScript\n数据库：SQLite (better-sqlite3)\n```\n\n**优势**:\n- ✅ 轻量级，无复杂构建流程\n- ✅ ts-fsrs 是官方推荐的 FSRS 实现\n- ✅ SQLite 单文件数据库，易于备份和迁移\n- ✅ 性能足够（581 张卡片查询 <10ms）\n\n**建议改进**:\n- ⏳ 前端可引入 Vue.js 或 React 提升开发效率\n- ⏳ 使用 Vite 作为构建工具\n- ⏳ 添加 TypeScript 提升代码质量\n\n---\n\n## 📝 使用指南\n\n### 导入 ANKI 卡包\n\n1. **访问导入页面**\n   ```\n   http://localhost:3001\n   → 点击左侧导航\"导入\"\n   ```\n\n2. **选择卡包文件**\n   ```\n   点击\"选择 .apkg 文件\"\n   选择你的 .apkg 文件\n   ```\n\n3. **预览卡包**\n   ```\n   自动显示:\n   - 卡片数量\n   - 牌组数量\n   - 模型信息\n   ```\n\n4. **开始导入**\n   ```\n   选择目标牌组\n   点击\"开始导入\"\n   等待完成（286 张约 2 秒）\n   ```\n\n### API 使用示例\n\n```bash\n# 预览卡包\ncurl -X POST \\\n  -F \"apkg=@chinese_medicine.apkg\" \\\n  http://localhost:3001/api/apkg/preview\n\n# 导入卡包\ncurl -X POST \\\n  -F \"apkg=@chinese_medicine.apkg\" \\\n  -F \"deckId=1\" \\\n  http://localhost:3001/api/apkg/import\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 已知问题与限制\n\n### 1. 媒体文件不支持\n- ❌ 图片、音频文件暂不导入\n- 📋 原因：需要额外的媒体文件存储和引用映射\n- 🔮 计划：Phase 3 实现\n\n### 2. 卡片模板样式\n- ⚠️ Anki 卡片模板可能不完全匹配\n- 📋 原因：HTML/CSS 模板解析复杂\n- 💡 解决：统一使用简化的 question/answer 格式\n\n### 3. 大批量导入性能\n- ⚠️ 1000+ 卡片导入可能较慢\n- 📋 原因：逐条插入数据库\n- 🔮 优化：使用事务批量插入\n\n### 4. 浏览器兼容性\n- ✅ Chrome/Edge: 完全支持\n- ✅ Firefox: 完全支持\n- ⚠️ Safari: 部分 CSS 动画可能不流畅\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 下一步计划\n\n### Phase 2: UI 完善 (预计 2-3 天)\n- [ ] 完成 index-v2.html 所有视图迁移\n- [ ] 实现卡片翻转动画\n- [ ] 添加键盘快捷键（1-5 评分）\n- [ ] 优化移动端响应式布局\n- [ ] 添加加载状态和过渡动画\n\n### Phase 3: 功能增强 (预计 3-5 天)\n- [ ] 媒体文件支持（图片、音频）\n- [ ] 卡片模板系统\n- [ ] 导出功能（导出为 APKG/CSV）\n- [ ] 卡片搜索和筛选增强\n- [ ] 学习统计图表（Chart.js）\n\n### Phase 4: 测试与优化 (预计 2-3 天)\n- [ ] 单元测试（Jest）\n- [ ] E2E 测试（Playwright）\n- [ ] 性能优化（数据库索引、缓存）\n- [ ] 文档完善（README、API 文档）\n\n### Phase 5: 部署准备 (预计 1-2 天)\n- [ ] Docker 容器化\n- [ ] 环境变量配置\n- [ ] 生产环境优化\n- [ ] 备份和恢复脚本\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能指标\n\n### 当前性能\n```\n数据库大小：~500KB (581 张卡片)\n查询性能:\n  - 获取待复习卡片：<5ms\n  - 获取所有卡片：<10ms\n  - 导入 286 张卡片：~2 秒\n\n服务器内存：~50MB\n启动时间：<1 秒\n```\n\n### 目标性能\n```\n支持卡片数：10,000+\n查询性能：<50ms\n导入速度：100 张/秒\n并发用户：10+\n```\n\n---\n\n## 💡 经验总结\n\n### 成功经验\n1. **使用现有库**: adm-zip 完美解析 APKG 文件\n2. **渐进式重构**: 保持核心功能稳定，逐步改进\n3. **API 先行**: 先实现后端 API，再开发前端\n4. **测试驱动**: 每个功能都有实际测试验证\n\n### 踩坑记录\n1. **APKG 格式**: 最初尝试 apkg-reader 库，但 API 不友好，改用 adm-zip 直接解析\n2. **字段分隔符**: Anki 使用 `\\x1f` 而非制表符，需要特殊处理\n3. **路径问题**: server.js 引入模块时路径错误，需要相对路径调整\n4. **文件上传**: Multer 配置需要指定文件过滤器和大小限制\n\n### 改进建议\n1. **代码组织**: 将 API 路由分离到独立文件\n2. **错误处理**: 添加更详细的错误日志\n3. **安全性**: 添加文件类型验证和大小限制\n4. **文档**: 及时更新 README 和 API 文档\n\n---\n\n## 📞 联系与支持\n\n**项目位置**: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory`\n\n**启动服务**:\n```bash\ncd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web\nnode server.js\n```\n\n**访问地址**: http://localhost:3001\n\n---\n\n**报告生成时间**: 2026-02-27 15:45 GMT+8  \n**重构版本**: v2.0.0  \n**状态**: Phase 1 完成，Phase 2 进行中\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179136023}}
{"type":"message","id":"85d3a123","parentId":"8b49b125","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:58:56.032Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3a380dddc59640bd83e158b3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FSRS-Memory 重构计划\n\n## 📋 项目概述\n\n将 fsrs-memory 重构为功能完善、界面美观的 WEB 版 ANKI 应用。\n\n## 🎯 重构目标\n\n### 1. 引入开源 FSRS 实现 ✅\n- **当前状态**：已使用 ts-fsrs v5.2.3\n- **算法版本**：FSRS-6（最新）\n- **结论**：无需更改，保持现有实现\n\n### 2. 支持 ANKI 卡包导入\n- **技术方案**：使用 `anki-apkg-parser` 或 `apkg-reader.js`\n- **APKG 格式**：SQLite 数据库 + 媒体文件的 ZIP 包\n- **实现步骤**：\n  1. 安装解析库\n  2. 创建导入 API 端点\n  3. 前端上传界面\n  4. 媒体文件处理\n\n### 3. WEB 功能完善\n- **学习模式**：\n  - 卡片翻转动画\n  - 倒计时显示\n  - 快捷键支持（1-5 评分）\n  - 学习进度追踪\n- **牌组管理**：\n  - 创建/编辑/删除\n  - 牌组统计\n  - 卡片批量操作\n- **卡片管理**：\n  - 搜索/筛选\n  - 批量编辑\n  - 卡片预览\n\n### 4. 界面美化\n- **设计原则**：\n  - 现代化、简洁\n  - 对标 AnkiWeb 体验\n  - 响应式设计\n  - 流畅动画\n- **技术选型**：\n  - 保持原生 JS（轻量）\n  - 使用 CSS 变量（主题）\n  - 引入 Tailwind CSS 或保持自定义 CSS\n  - 添加图标库（Phosphor Icons / Lucide）\n\n## 📐 技术架构\n\n### 后端（保持不变）\n```\nExpress.js + better-sqlite3 + ts-fsrs\n```\n\n### 前端（升级）\n```\n原生 HTML/CSS/JavaScript\n+ Tailwind CSS (CDN)\n+ Phosphor Icons (图标)\n+ 自定义动画\n```\n\n### 新增功能模块\n```\n- APKG 导入模块\n- 媒体文件存储\n- 卡片模板系统\n- 学习统计图表\n```\n\n## 📁 项目结构\n\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── src/\n│   ├── fsrs.js          # FSRS 算法（不变）\n│   ├── scheduler.js     # 调度器（不变）\n│   ├── storage.js       # 存储（扩展 APKG 导入）\n│   └── apkg-import.js   # 新增：APKG 解析导入\n├── web/\n│   ├── server.js        # Express API（扩展导入端点）\n│   ├── public/\n│   │   ├── index.html   # 重构：更简洁的 HTML\n│   │   ├── styles.css   # 重构：现代化样式\n│   │   ├── app.js       # 重构：模块化 JS\n│   │   └── assets/      # 新增：图标、字体\n│   └── uploads/         # 新增：临时上传目录\n├── data/\n│   ├── cards.db         # 主数据库\n│   └── media/           # 新增：卡片媒体文件\n├── REFACTOR_PLAN.md     # 本文档\n└── package.json\n```\n\n## 🚀 实施阶段\n\n### Phase 1: APKG 导入功能\n- [ ] 安装 anki-apkg-parser\n- [ ] 实现后端导入 API\n- [ ] 前端上传界面\n- [ ] 测试 chinese_medicine.apkg\n\n### Phase 2: UI 重构\n- [ ] 设计新界面布局\n- [ ] 实现响应式导航\n- [ ] 卡片学习界面优化\n- [ ] 添加动画效果\n\n### Phase 3: 功能增强\n- [ ] 快捷键支持\n- [ ] 卡片模板系统\n- [ ] 统计图表\n- [ ] 导出功能\n\n### Phase 4: 测试与优化\n- [ ] 功能测试\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档编写\n\n## 📝 每轮迭代总结\n\n### Iteration 1: 调研与规划\n- ✅ 完成 FSRS 实现调研\n- ✅ 完成 APKG 解析库调研\n- ✅ 制定详细重构计划\n\n---\n\n**版本**: 2.0.0  \n**开始日期**: 2026-02-27  \n**状态**: 规划完成，准备实施\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179136030}}
{"type":"message","id":"ddb609cb","parentId":"85d3a123","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:58:58.071Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me check the current state of the UI files to understand what's been implemented and what needs to be done.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fbb99e68f9b34ce3b9845842","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/index-v2.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5124f68a5f5549d4a1fa8c7c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/index.html"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":14929,"output":134,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15063,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179136032}}
{"type":"message","id":"d1c0d67c","parentId":"ddb609cb","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:58:58.097Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fbb99e68f9b34ce3b9845842","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>FSRS Memory - 智能记忆卡片</title>\n  \n  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Phosphor Icons -->\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Custom Config -->\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      darkMode: 'class',\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          colors: {\n            primary: {\n              50: '#eff6ff',\n              100: '#dbeafe',\n              200: '#bfdbfe',\n              300: '#93c5fd',\n              400: '#60a5fa',\n              500: '#3b82f6',\n              600: '#2563eb',\n              700: '#1d4ed8',\n              800: '#1e40af',\n              900: '#1e3a8a',\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  \n  <style>\n    /* Custom styles that Tailwind can't handle */\n    .card-flip {\n      perspective: 1000px;\n    }\n    .card-inner {\n      transition: transform 0.6s;\n      transform-style: preserve-3d;\n    }\n    .card-flipped .card-inner {\n      transform: rotateY(180deg);\n    }\n    .card-front, .card-back {\n      backface-visibility: hidden;\n    }\n    .card-back {\n      transform: rotateY(180deg);\n    }\n    \n    /* Smooth transitions */\n    .fade-in {\n      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in;\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n    \n    /* Custom scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #475569;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200\">\n  <div id=\"app\" class=\"flex h-screen overflow-hidden\">\n    \n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"w-64 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-r border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 flex flex-col\">\n      <!-- Logo -->\n      <div class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-brain text-3xl text-primary-600\"></i>\n          <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">FSRS Memory</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Navigation -->\n      <nav class=\"flex-1 p-4 space-y-1 overflow-y-auto\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors active\" data-view=\"study\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-book-open text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>学习</span>\n          <span class=\"ml-auto badge bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900 text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\" id=\"due-badge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"cards\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-cards text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>卡片</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"decks\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-folder-open text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>牌组</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"import\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-download-simple text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>导入</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"add\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-plus-circle text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>添加</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"stats\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-chart-bar text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>统计</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n      \n      <!-- Stats Summary -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\">\n          <div class=\"text-center p-2 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"total-cards\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">总卡片</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-center p-2 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-orange-600\" id=\"due-cards\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">待复习</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Theme Toggle -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <button id=\"theme-toggle-btn\" onclick=\"toggleTheme()\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-moon text-lg\" id=\"theme-icon\"></i>\n          <span id=\"theme-text\">暗色模式</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n    \n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\">\n      <!-- Top Bar -->\n      <header class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-6 py-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\" id=\"page-title\">今日学习</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1\" id=\"page-subtitle\">开始你的复习之旅</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <select id=\"deck-select\" onchange=\"changeDeck(this.value)\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\">\n              <option value=\"\">全部牌组</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n      \n      <!-- Content Views -->\n      <div class=\"p-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Study View -->\n        <section id=\"study-view\" class=\"view active fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n            <!-- Progress -->\n            <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">\n                进度：<span id=\"study-progress\" class=\"font-medium\">0 / 0</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded\">快捷键：1-5</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Card Area -->\n            <div class=\"card-flip mb-6\" id=\"card-flip-area\">\n              <div class=\"card-inner relative bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 min-h-[400px] cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"toggleCardFlip()\">\n                <!-- Front -->\n                <div class=\"card-front absolute inset-0 p-8 flex flex-col\">\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center\">\n                      <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">问题</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium\" id=\"question-text\">加载中...</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <button class=\"px-6 py-2 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); showAnswer()\">\n                      显示答案\n                    </button>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Back -->\n                <div class=\"card-back absolute inset-0 p-8 flex flex-col\">\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center\">\n                      <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">答案</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium\" id=\"answer-text\">加载中...</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Rating Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2\" id=\"rating-buttons\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(1)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">Again</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-1\">1m</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900 hover:bg-orange-50 dark:hover:bg-orange-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(2)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Hard</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-2\">10m</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(3)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">Good</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-3\">1d</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-green-200 dark:border-green-900 hover:bg-green-50 dark:hover:bg-green-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(4)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">Easy</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-4\">4d</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-900 hover:bg-purple-50 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(5)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400\">Perfect</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-5\">10d</div>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Empty State -->\n            <div class=\"empty-state text-center py-16\" id=\"no-cards-message\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <i class=\"ph ph-check-circle text-6xl text-green-500 mb-4\"></i>\n              <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">太棒了！</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6\">今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n              <button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">\n                添加新卡片\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n        \n        <!-- Other views will be loaded from original index.html -->\n        <div id=\"other-views-container\"></div>\n        \n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n  \n  <!-- Toast -->\n  <div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast fixed bottom-4 right-4 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 z-50\"></div>\n  \n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179138092}}
{"type":"message","id":"254e39c8","parentId":"d1c0d67c","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:58:58.107Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5124f68a5f5549d4a1fa8c7c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>FSRS Memory - 间隔重复学习</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\">\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <span class=\"logo-icon\">🧠</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-text\">FSRS Memory</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Theme Toggle -->\n      <div class=\"theme-toggle\">\n        <button class=\"theme-btn\" id=\"theme-toggle-btn\" onclick=\"toggleTheme()\">\n          <span id=\"theme-icon\">🌙</span>\n          <span id=\"theme-text\">切换主题</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Deck Selector -->\n      <div class=\"deck-selector\">\n        <div class=\"deck-selector-label\">当前牌组</div>\n        <select class=\"deck-select\" id=\"deck-select\" onchange=\"changeDeck(this.value)\">\n          <option value=\"\">全部牌组</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n      \n      <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item active\" data-view=\"study\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📖</span>\n          <span>学习</span>\n          <span class=\"badge\" id=\"due-badge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"cards\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📚</span>\n          <span>卡片</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"decks\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">🗂️</span>\n          <span>牌组</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"add\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">➕</span>\n          <span>添加</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"import\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📥</span>\n          <span>导入</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"stats\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📊</span>\n          <span>统计</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n      \n      <div class=\"sidebar-stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"total-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">总卡片</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"due-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">待复习</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n      <!-- Study View -->\n      <section id=\"study-view\" class=\"view active\">\n        <div class=\"study-header\">\n          <h1>今日复习</h1>\n          <div class=\"study-progress\">\n            <span id=\"study-progress\">0 / 0</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"deck-info\" id=\"deck-info\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"study-container\" id=\"study-container\">\n          <!-- Card will be loaded here -->\n          <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"no-cards-message\">\n            <div class=\"empty-icon\">🎉</div>\n            <h2>太棒了！</h2>\n            <p>今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">添加新卡片</button>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"card-area\" id=\"card-area\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"card-header\">\n                <span class=\"card-id\">#<span id=\"card-id\">0</span></span>\n                <span class=\"card-state\" id=\"card-state\">new</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-front\" id=\"card-front\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">问题</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"question-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-back\" id=\"card-back\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">答案</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"answer-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-hint\" id=\"show-answer-btn\" onclick=\"showAnswer()\">显示答案</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"rating-buttons\" id=\"rating-buttons\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-again\" onclick=\"rateCard(1)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Again</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-1\">1m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-hard\" onclick=\"rateCard(2)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Hard</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-2\">10m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-good\" onclick=\"rateCard(3)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Good</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-3\">1d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-easy\" onclick=\"rateCard(4)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Easy</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-4\">4d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-perfect\" onclick=\"rateCard(5)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Perfect</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-5\">10d</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Cards List View -->\n      <section id=\"cards-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>所有卡片</h1>\n          <div class=\"search-box\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"card-search\" placeholder=\"搜索卡片...\" oninput=\"filterCards()\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"cards-list\" id=\"cards-list\">\n          <!-- Cards will be loaded here -->\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Decks View -->\n      <section id=\"decks-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>牌组管理</h1>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showCreateDeckModal()\">➕ 新建牌组</button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"decks-grid\" id=\"decks-grid\">\n          <!-- Decks will be loaded here -->\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Add Card View -->\n      <section id=\"add-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>添加卡片</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"add-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"deck-select-add\">选择牌组</label>\n            <select id=\"deck-select-add\">\n              <!-- Options populated by JS -->\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"question-input\">问题</label>\n            <textarea id=\"question-input\" placeholder=\"输入问题...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"answer-input\">答案</label>\n            <textarea id=\"answer-input\" placeholder=\"输入答案...\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" onclick=\"addCard()\">添加卡片</button>\n          \n          <div class=\"quick-add\">\n            <h3>快速添加 (格式: 问题::答案)</h3>\n            <textarea id=\"quick-add-input\" placeholder=\"每行一个卡片，格式: 问题::答案\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"quickAdd()\">批量添加</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <!-- Import APKG View -->\n      <section id=\"import-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>导入 ANKI 卡包</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"import-form\">\n          <div class=\"import-description\">\n            <p>📦 导入 .apkg 格式的 Anki 卡包文件</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>支持所有标准 .apkg 文件</li>\n              <li>自动保留卡片内容和字段</li>\n              <li>可选择导入到指定牌组</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"import-deck-select\">导入到牌组</label>\n            <select id=\"import-deck-select\">\n              <option value=\"1\">默认牌组</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"apkg-file\" class=\"file-label\">\n              <span class=\"file-icon\">📁</span>\n              <span class=\"file-text\">选择 .apkg 文件</span>\n            </label>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"apkg-file\" accept=\".apkg\" style=\"display: none;\" onchange=\"onFileSelected()\">\n            <div id=\"file-info\" class=\"file-info\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <span id=\"file-name\"></span>\n              <span id=\"file-size\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div id=\"preview-area\" class=\"preview-area\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <h3>📋 卡包预览</h3>\n            <div class=\"preview-stats\">\n              <div class=\"preview-stat\">\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-value\" id=\"preview-cards\">0</span>\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-label\">卡片数</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"preview-stat\">\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-value\" id=\"preview-decks\">0</span>\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-label\">牌组数</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"preview-stat\">\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-value\" id=\"preview-models\">0</span>\n                <span class=\"preview-stat-label\">模型数</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"preview-details\" class=\"preview-details\"></div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" id=\"import-btn\" onclick=\"importAPKG()\" disabled>\n            📥 开始导入\n          </button>\n          \n          <div id=\"import-progress\" class=\"import-progress\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n              <div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress-fill\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"progress-text\">正在导入...</p>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div id=\"import-result\" class=\"import-result\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Stats View -->\n      <section id=\"stats-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>学习统计</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📚</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-total\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">总卡片数</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-due\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">⏰</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-due\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">待复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-done\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">✅</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-reviewed\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">已复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🆕</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-new\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">新卡片</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📈</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-learning\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">学习中</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🎯</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-ease\">2.5</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">平均难度</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-chart\">\n          <h3>学习进度</h3>\n          <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-new\" style=\"background: #3498db; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-learning\" style=\"background: #f39c12; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-review\" style=\"background: #27ae60; width: 0%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress-legend\">\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #3498db\"></span> 新卡片</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #f39c12\"></span> 学习</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #27ae60\"></span> 复习</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Delete Confirmation Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"delete-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <h3>确认删除</h3>\n      <p>确定要删除这张卡片吗？此操作无法撤销。</p>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-danger\" id=\"confirm-delete-btn\">删除</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Deck Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"deck-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <h3 id=\"deck-modal-title\">新建牌组</h3>\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label for=\"deck-name-input\">牌组名称</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"deck-name-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组名称...\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label for=\"deck-desc-input\">描述（可选）</label>\n        <textarea id=\"deck-desc-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组描述...\" rows=\"2\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeDeckModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"save-deck-btn\">保存</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Toast Notification -->\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\"></div>\n\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179138104}}
{"type":"message","id":"2fd4e47b","parentId":"254e39c8","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:00.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me check the current app.js file to understand what JavaScript functionality exists.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ce1b8c5f88e149cb92ad8f36","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/app.js"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":22550,"output":76,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22626,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179138108}}
{"type":"message","id":"99f6ed93","parentId":"2fd4e47b","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:00.382Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ce1b8c5f88e149cb92ad8f36","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// FSRS Memory Web UI - Application Logic with Multi-deck & Theme support\n\nconst API_BASE = window.location.origin;\n\n// State\nlet currentView = 'study';\nlet currentDeckId = null;\nlet dueCards = [];\nlet allCards = [];\nlet allDecks = [];\nlet currentCardIndex = 0;\nlet currentCard = null;\nlet isAnswerShown = false;\nlet currentTheme = 'light';\n\n// ==================== Initialization ====================\n\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  initTheme();\n  initNavigation();\n  initKeyboardShortcuts();\n  loadDecks();\n  loadStats();\n  loadDueCards();\n});\n\n// ==================== Theme ====================\n\nasync function initTheme() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    if (result.success) {\n      currentTheme = result.data || 'light';\n      applyTheme(currentTheme);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load theme:', error);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction applyTheme(theme) {\n  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n  document.getElementById('theme-icon').textContent = theme === 'dark' ? '☀️' : '🌙';\n  currentTheme = theme;\n}\n\nasync function toggleTheme() {\n  const newTheme = currentTheme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';\n  try {\n    await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/settings/theme`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ theme: newTheme })\n    });\n    applyTheme(newTheme);\n    showToast(`已切换到${newTheme === 'dark' ? '暗色' : '亮色'}主题`, 'success');\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to save theme:', error);\n    showToast('主题切换失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Navigation ====================\n\nfunction initNavigation() {\n  const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item');\n  navItems.forEach(item => {\n    item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const view = item.dataset.view;\n      showView(view);\n    });\n  });\n}\n\nfunction showView(view) {\n  // Update nav\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(item => {\n    item.classList.toggle('active', item.dataset.view === view);\n  });\n  \n  // Update view\n  document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v => {\n    v.classList.toggle('active', v.id === `${view}-view`);\n  });\n  \n  currentView = view;\n  \n  // Load data for specific views\n  if (view === 'study') {\n    loadDueCards();\n  } else if (view === 'cards') {\n    loadAllCards();\n  } else if (view === 'decks') {\n    loadDecksGrid();\n  } else if (view === 'stats') {\n    loadStats();\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Deck Management ====================\n\nasync function loadDecks() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      allDecks = result.data;\n      updateDeckSelectors();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction updateDeckSelectors() {\n  // Update sidebar deck selector\n  const sidebarSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select');\n  const addViewSelect = document.getElementById('deck-select-add');\n  \n  const options = allDecks.map(deck => \n    `<option value=\"${deck.id}\">${deck.name} (${deck.due_count || 0} 待复习)</option>`\n  ).join('');\n  \n  sidebarSelect.innerHTML = '<option value=\"\">全部牌组</option>' + options;\n  addViewSelect.innerHTML = options;\n  \n  // Set default selection\n  if (allDecks.length > 0 && !currentDeckId) {\n    addViewSelect.value = allDecks[0].id;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function changeDeck(deckId) {\n  currentDeckId = deckId ? parseInt(deckId) : null;\n  \n  // Update deck info in study view\n  const deckInfo = document.getElementById('deck-info');\n  if (currentDeckId) {\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === currentDeckId);\n    deckInfo.textContent = `当前牌组: ${deck ? deck.name : ''}`;\n  } else {\n    deckInfo.textContent = '';\n  }\n  \n  // Reload data\n  if (currentView === 'study') {\n    loadDueCards();\n  } else if (currentView === 'cards') {\n    loadAllCards();\n  } else if (currentView === 'stats') {\n    loadStats();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadDecksGrid() {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      renderDecksGrid(result.data);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load decks:', error);\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderDecksGrid(decks) {\n  const container = document.getElementById('decks-grid');\n  \n  container.innerHTML = decks.map(deck => `\n    <div class=\"deck-card\">\n      <div class=\"deck-card-header\">\n        <div class=\"deck-card-name\">${escapeHtml(deck.name)}</div>\n        ${deck.id === 1 ? '<span class=\"deck-card-default\">默认</span>' : ''}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"deck-card-desc\">${escapeHtml(deck.description || '暂无描述')}</div>\n      <div class=\"deck-card-stats\">\n        <div class=\"deck-stat\">\n          <div class=\"deck-stat-value\">${deck.card_count || 0}</div>\n          <div class=\"deck-stat-label\">卡片数</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"deck-stat\">\n          <div class=\"deck-stat-value\">${deck.due_count || 0}</div>\n          <div class=\"deck-stat-label\">待复习</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"deck-card-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-small\" onclick=\"showEditDeckModal(${deck.id})\">编辑</button>\n        ${deck.id !== 1 ? `<button class=\"btn btn-danger btn-small\" onclick=\"confirmDeleteDeck(${deck.id})\">删除</button>` : ''}\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-small\" onclick=\"selectDeckAndStudy(${deck.id})\">学习</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `).join('');\n}\n\nfunction showCreateDeckModal() {\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '新建牌组';\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = '';\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = '';\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = createDeck;\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\n}\n\nfunction showEditDeckModal(deckId) {\n  const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === deckId);\n  if (!deck) return;\n  \n  document.getElementById('deck-modal-title').textContent = '编辑牌组';\n  document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value = deck.name;\n  document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value = deck.description || '';\n  document.getElementById('save-deck-btn').onclick = () => updateDeck(deckId);\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'flex';\n}\n\nfunction closeDeckModal() {\n  document.getElementById('deck-modal').style.display = 'none';\n}\n\nasync function createDeck() {\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\n  \n  if (!name) {\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('牌组创建成功', 'success');\n      closeDeckModal();\n      loadDecks();\n      loadDecksGrid();\n    } else {\n      showToast(result.error || '创建失败', 'error');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to create deck:', error);\n    showToast('创建失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function updateDeck(deckId) {\n  const name = document.getElementById('deck-name-input').value.trim();\n  const description = document.getElementById('deck-desc-input').value.trim();\n  \n  if (!name) {\n    showToast('请输入牌组名称', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\n      method: 'PUT',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ name, description })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('牌组更新成功', 'success');\n      closeDeckModal();\n      loadDecks();\n      loadDecksGrid();\n    } else {\n      showToast(result.error || '更新失败', 'error');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to update deck:', error);\n    showToast('更新失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction confirmDeleteDeck(deckId) {\n  if (confirm('确定要删除这个牌组吗？该牌组中的卡片将移动到默认牌组。')) {\n    deleteDeck(deckId);\n  }\n}\n\nasync function deleteDeck(deckId) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/decks/${deckId}`, {\n      method: 'DELETE'\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('牌组已删除', 'success');\n      loadDecks();\n      loadDecksGrid();\n      loadStats();\n    } else {\n      showToast(result.error || '删除失败', 'error');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to delete deck:', error);\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction selectDeckAndStudy(deckId) {\n  document.getElementById('deck-select').value = deckId;\n  changeDeck(deckId);\n  showView('study');\n}\n\n// ==================== Keyboard Shortcuts ====================\n\nfunction initKeyboardShortcuts() {\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    // Don't trigger shortcuts when typing in inputs\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'INPUT' || e.target.tagName === 'TEXTAREA' || e.target.tagName === 'SELECT') {\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    // Study view shortcuts\n    if (currentView === 'study' && dueCards.length > 0) {\n      if (!isAnswerShown) {\n        // Space or Enter to show answer\n        if (e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'Enter') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          showAnswer();\n        }\n      } else {\n        // Number keys 1-5 for rating\n        if (e.key >= '1' && e.key <= '5') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          rateCard(parseInt(e.key));\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // Navigation shortcuts\n    if (e.altKey) {\n      switch(e.key) {\n        case '1':\n          showView('study');\n          break;\n        case '2':\n          showView('cards');\n          break;\n        case '3':\n          showView('decks');\n          break;\n        case '4':\n          showView('add');\n          break;\n        case '5':\n          showView('stats');\n          break;\n      }\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// ==================== Study View ====================\n\nasync function loadDueCards() {\n  try {\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards/due`;\n    if (currentDeckId) {\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\n    }\n    \n    const response = await fetch(url);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    // Handle API error response\n    if (!result.success) {\n      console.error('API error:', result.error);\n      showToast(result.error || '加载失败', 'error');\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    dueCards = result.data;\n    currentCardIndex = 0;\n    isAnswerShown = false;\n    updateStudyProgress();\n    \n    if (dueCards.length > 0) {\n      showCard();\n    } else {\n      showEmptyState();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load due cards:', error);\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction updateStudyProgress() {\n  const studied = currentCardIndex;\n  const total = dueCards.length;\n  document.getElementById('study-progress').textContent = `${studied} / ${total}`;\n  document.getElementById('due-badge').textContent = total;\n}\n\nfunction showCard() {\n  isAnswerShown = false;\n  \n  const emptyState = document.getElementById('no-cards-message');\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-area');\n  \n  emptyState.style.display = 'none';\n  cardArea.style.display = 'flex';\n  cardArea.style.flexDirection = 'column';\n  cardArea.style.alignItems = 'center';\n  \n  currentCard = dueCards[currentCardIndex];\n  \n  // Reset card display with animation\n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\n  \n  cardFront.style.display = 'block';\n  cardFront.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\n  cardBack.style.display = 'none';\n  \n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'inline-block';\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'none';\n  \n  // Set card content\n  document.getElementById('card-id').textContent = currentCard.id;\n  document.getElementById('card-state').textContent = currentCard.state;\n  document.getElementById('card-state').className = `card-state ${currentCard.state}`;\n  document.getElementById('question-text').textContent = currentCard.question;\n  document.getElementById('answer-text').textContent = currentCard.answer;\n  \n  // Update intervals preview\n  updateIntervalPreview();\n  \n  // Focus the show answer button for accessibility\n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').focus();\n}\n\nasync function showAnswer() {\n  isAnswerShown = true;\n  \n  // Fetch preview intervals from server\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}/preview`);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      const previews = result.data;\n      document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = previews[1] || '1m';\n      document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = previews[2] || '10m';\n      document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = previews[3] || '1d';\n      document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = previews[4] || '4d';\n      document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = previews[5] || '10d';\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load preview:', error);\n    // Fallback to calculated intervals\n    const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\n    document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\n    document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\n    document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\n    document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\n    document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\n  }\n  \n  const cardFront = document.getElementById('card-front');\n  const cardBack = document.getElementById('card-back');\n  \n  cardFront.style.display = 'none';\n  cardBack.style.display = 'flex';\n  cardBack.style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease';\n  \n  document.getElementById('show-answer-btn').style.display = 'none';\n  document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'flex';\n  \n  // Focus first rating button\n  document.querySelector('.rating-btn').focus();\n}\n\nfunction updateIntervalPreview() {\n  // Calculate interval previews based on current card state\n  const intervals = calculateIntervals(currentCard);\n  \n  document.getElementById('interval-1').textContent = intervals[0];\n  document.getElementById('interval-2').textContent = intervals[1];\n  document.getElementById('interval-3').textContent = intervals[2];\n  document.getElementById('interval-4').textContent = intervals[3];\n  document.getElementById('interval-5').textContent = intervals[4];\n}\n\nfunction calculateIntervals(card) {\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions } = card;\n  ease_factor = ease_factor || 2.5;\n  interval = interval || 0;\n  \n  return [\n    '1m',  // Again\n    Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2)) + 'm',  // Hard\n    repetitions === 0 ? '1d' : (repetitions === 1 ? '6d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor) + 'd'),  // Good\n    repetitions === 0 ? '4d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3) + 'd',  // Easy\n    repetitions === 0 ? '10d' : Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5) + 'd'  // Perfect\n  ];\n}\n\nasync function rateCard(rating) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/review/${currentCard.id}`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ rating })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      currentCardIndex++;\n      updateStudyProgress();\n      \n      if (currentCardIndex < dueCards.length) {\n        showCard();\n      } else {\n        // All cards reviewed\n        showCompleteState();\n      }\n      \n      // Update stats in background\n      loadStats();\n      loadDecks(); // Update deck due counts\n      \n      // Show toast with next interval\n      showToast(`已评分 - 下次复习: ${result.nextInterval}`, 'success');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to rate card:', error);\n    showToast('评分失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showEmptyState() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\n  container.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"no-cards-message\">\n      <div class=\"empty-icon\">🎉</div>\n      <h2>太棒了！</h2>\n      <p>${currentDeckId ? '这个牌组' : '今天'}没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">添加新卡片</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nfunction showCompleteState() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('study-container');\n  container.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"empty-state\">\n      <div class=\"empty-icon\">🏆</div>\n      <h2>完成！</h2>\n      <p>恭喜完成今日复习</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('stats')\">查看统计</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ==================== Cards List ====================\n\nasync function loadAllCards() {\n  try {\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/cards`;\n    if (currentDeckId) {\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\n    }\n    \n    const response = await fetch(url);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      allCards = result.data;\n      renderCardsList();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load cards:', error);\n    showToast('加载失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderCardsList() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('cards-list');\n  const searchTerm = document.getElementById('card-search').value.toLowerCase();\n  \n  const filteredCards = allCards.filter(card => \n    card.question.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm) ||\n    card.answer.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm)\n  );\n  \n  if (filteredCards.length === 0) {\n    container.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"empty-state\">\n        <div class=\"empty-icon\">📭</div>\n        <h2>没有找到卡片</h2>\n        <p>${searchTerm ? '尝试其他搜索词' : '添加你的第一张卡片吧'}</p>\n      </div>\n    `;\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  container.innerHTML = filteredCards.map(card => {\n    const deck = allDecks.find(d => d.id === card.deck_id);\n    return `\n      <div class=\"card-item\" data-id=\"${card.id}\">\n        <div class=\"card-item-content\">\n          <div class=\"card-item-header\">\n            <span class=\"card-item-id\">#${card.id}</span>\n            <span class=\"card-item-deck\">${deck ? deck.name : '默认'}</span>\n            <span class=\"card-item-state card-state ${card.state}\">${card.state}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-item-question\">${escapeHtml(card.question)}</div>\n          <div class=\"card-item-answer\">${escapeHtml(card.answer)}</div>\n          <div class=\"card-item-meta\">\n            <span>间隔: ${card.interval || 0}天</span>\n            <span>复习: ${card.repetitions || 0}次</span>\n            <span>难度: ${(card.ease_factor || 2.5).toFixed(2)}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-item-actions\">\n          <button class=\"btn-icon\" onclick=\"editCard(${card.id})\" title=\"编辑\">✏️</button>\n          <button class=\"btn-icon danger\" onclick=\"confirmDelete(${card.id})\" title=\"删除\">🗑️</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `;\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nfunction filterCards() {\n  renderCardsList();\n}\n\nfunction escapeHtml(text) {\n  const div = document.createElement('div');\n  div.textContent = text;\n  return div.innerHTML;\n}\n\n// ==================== Add Card ====================\n\nasync function addCard() {\n  const question = document.getElementById('question-input').value.trim();\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer-input').value.trim();\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\n  \n  if (!question || !answer) {\n    showToast('请填写问题和答案', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  // Basic validation\n  if (question.length > 1000 || answer.length > 5000) {\n    showToast('输入内容过长', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ \n        question, \n        answer,\n        deck_id: deckId || 1\n      })\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('卡片添加成功', 'success');\n      document.getElementById('question-input').value = '';\n      document.getElementById('answer-input').value = '';\n      loadStats();\n      loadDecks();\n      // Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added card\n      if (currentView === 'study') {\n        loadDueCards();\n      }\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\n    showToast('添加失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function quickAdd() {\n  const input = document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value.trim();\n  const deckId = document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value;\n  \n  if (!input) {\n    showToast('请输入卡片内容', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  const lines = input.split('\\n').filter(line => line.includes('::'));\n  if (lines.length === 0) {\n    showToast('格式错误，请使用 \"问题::答案\" 格式', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  let successCount = 0;\n  \n  for (const line of lines) {\n    const [question, answer] = line.split('::').map(s => s.trim());\n    if (question && answer) {\n      try {\n        await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards`, {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          body: JSON.stringify({ \n            question, \n            answer,\n            deck_id: deckId || 1\n          })\n        });\n        successCount++;\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Failed to add card:', error);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  showToast(`成功添加 ${successCount} 张卡片`, 'success');\n  document.getElementById('quick-add-input').value = '';\n  loadStats();\n  loadDecks();\n  // Refresh due cards if in study view to show newly added cards\n  if (currentView === 'study') {\n    loadDueCards();\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Stats ====================\n\nasync function loadStats() {\n  try {\n    let url = `${API_BASE}/api/stats`;\n    if (currentDeckId) {\n      url += `?deck=${currentDeckId}`;\n    }\n    \n    const response = await fetch(url);\n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      const stats = result.data;\n      \n      // Update sidebar stats\n      document.getElementById('total-cards').textContent = stats.total;\n      document.getElementById('due-cards').textContent = stats.due;\n      \n      // Update stats view\n      document.getElementById('stat-total').textContent = stats.total;\n      document.getElementById('stat-due').textContent = stats.due;\n      document.getElementById('stat-reviewed').textContent = stats.reviewed;\n      document.getElementById('stat-new').textContent = stats.new;\n      document.getElementById('stat-learning').textContent = stats.learning;\n      document.getElementById('stat-ease').textContent = stats.avgEase;\n      \n      // Update progress bar\n      const total = stats.total || 1;\n      const newPercent = (stats.new / total) * 100;\n      const learningPercent = (stats.learning / total) * 100;\n      const reviewPercent = (stats.reviewed / total) * 100;\n      \n      document.getElementById('progress-new').style.width = `${newPercent}%`;\n      document.getElementById('progress-learning').style.width = `${learningPercent}%`;\n      document.getElementById('progress-review').style.width = `${reviewPercent}%`;\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to load stats:', error);\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Delete Card ====================\n\nfunction confirmDelete(cardId) {\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'flex';\n  document.getElementById('confirm-delete-btn').onclick = () => deleteCard(cardId);\n}\n\nfunction closeModal() {\n  document.getElementById('delete-modal').style.display = 'none';\n}\n\nasync function deleteCard(cardId) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/cards/${cardId}`, {\n      method: 'DELETE'\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      showToast('卡片已删除', 'success');\n      closeModal();\n      loadAllCards();\n      loadStats();\n      loadDecks();\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Failed to delete card:', error);\n    showToast('删除失败', 'error');\n  }\n}\n\n// ==================== Edit Card ====================\n\nasync function editCard(cardId) {\n  const card = allCards.find(c => c.id === cardId);\n  if (!card) return;\n  \n  // Set deck selector\n  document.getElementById('deck-select-add').value = card.deck_id;\n  \n  // Fill the add form with card data\n  document.getElementById('question-input').value = card.question;\n  document.getElementById('answer-input').value = card.answer;\n  \n  // Delete the old card\n  await deleteCard(cardId);\n  \n  // Switch to add view\n  showView('add');\n  showToast('已复制到编辑区，请修改后重新添加', 'success');\n}\n\n// ==================== Toast ====================\n\nfunction showToast(message, type = 'success') {\n  const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\n  toast.textContent = message;\n  toast.className = `toast ${type} show`;\n  \n  setTimeout(() => {\n    toast.classList.remove('show');\n  }, 3000);\n}\n\n// Make functions available globally\nwindow.showView = showView;\nwindow.showAnswer = showAnswer;\nwindow.rateCard = rateCard;\nwindow.addCard = addCard;\nwindow.quickAdd = quickAdd;\nwindow.filterCards = filterCards;\nwindow.confirmDelete = confirmDelete;\nwindow.closeModal = closeModal;\nwindow.deleteCard = deleteCard;\nwindow.editCard = editCard;\nwindow.showToast = showToast;\nwindow.toggleTheme = toggleTheme;\nwindow.changeDeck = changeDeck;\nwindow.showCreateDeckModal = showCreateDeckModal;\nwindow.showEditDeckModal = showEditDeckModal;\nwindow.closeDeckModal = closeDeckModal;\nwindow.createDeck = createDeck;\nwindow.updateDeck = updateDeck;\nwindow.confirmDeleteDeck = confirmDeleteDeck;\nwindow.deleteDeck = deleteDeck;\nwindow.selectDeckAndStudy = selectDeckAndStudy;\n\n// ==================== APKG Import ====================\n\nlet selectedAPKGFile = null;\nlet apkgPreview = null;\n\nfunction onFileSelected() {\n  const fileInput = document.getElementById('apkg-file');\n  const file = fileInput.files[0];\n  \n  if (!file) return;\n  \n  selectedAPKGFile = file;\n  \n  // Show file info\n  document.getElementById('file-name').textContent = file.name;\n  document.getElementById('file-size').textContent = formatFileSize(file.size);\n  document.getElementById('file-info').style.display = 'block';\n  \n  // Preview APKG\n  previewAPKG(file);\n}\n\nfunction formatFileSize(bytes) {\n  if (bytes < 1024) return bytes + ' B';\n  if (bytes < 1024 * 1024) return (bytes / 1024).toFixed(1) + ' KB';\n  return (bytes / (1024 * 1024)).toFixed(1) + ' MB';\n}\n\nasync function previewAPKG(file) {\n  const formData = new FormData();\n  formData.append('apkg', file);\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch('/api/apkg/preview', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      body: formData\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      apkgPreview = result;\n      showPreview(result);\n    } else {\n      showToast('预览失败：' + result.error, 'error');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    showToast('预览失败：' + error.message, 'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showPreview(preview) {\n  document.getElementById('preview-area').style.display = 'block';\n  document.getElementById('preview-cards').textContent = preview.cardsCount;\n  document.getElementById('preview-decks').textContent = preview.deckCount;\n  document.getElementById('preview-models').textContent = preview.modelCount;\n  \n  // Show deck and model details\n  const detailsDiv = document.getElementById('preview-details');\n  let html = '<div class=\"preview-list\">';\n  html += '<h4>牌组:</h4><ul>';\n  preview.decks.forEach(deck => {\n    html += `<li>${deck.name} (${deck.id === 1 ? '默认' : '自定义'})</li>`;\n  });\n  html += '</ul><h4>模型:</h4><ul>';\n  preview.models.forEach(model => {\n    html += `<li><strong>${model.name}</strong>: ${model.fields.join(', ')}</li>`;\n  });\n  html += '</ul></div>';\n  detailsDiv.innerHTML = html;\n  \n  // Enable import button\n  document.getElementById('import-btn').disabled = false;\n}\n\nasync function importAPKG() {\n  if (!selectedAPKGFile) {\n    showToast('请选择文件', 'error');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  const deckId = document.getElementById('import-deck-select').value;\n  const formData = new FormData();\n  formData.append('apkg', selectedAPKGFile);\n  formData.append('deckId', deckId);\n  \n  // Show progress\n  document.getElementById('import-progress').style.display = 'block';\n  document.getElementById('import-btn').disabled = true;\n  \n  try {\n    const response = await fetch('/api/apkg/import', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      body: formData\n    });\n    \n    const result = await response.json();\n    \n    if (result.success) {\n      // Show success\n      document.getElementById('import-result').style.display = 'block';\n      document.getElementById('import-result').innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"result-success\">\n          <h3>✅ 导入成功!</h3>\n          <p>成功导入 <strong>${result.importedCount}</strong> 张卡片</p>\n          <p>用时：${(result.duration / 1000).toFixed(1)} 秒</p>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('study')\">开始学习</button>\n        </div>\n      `;\n      \n      // Refresh deck list\n      await loadDecks();\n      await loadStatistics();\n      \n      // Reset form\n      selectedAPKGFile = null;\n      apkgPreview = null;\n      document.getElementById('apkg-file').value = '';\n    } else {\n      showToast('导入失败：' + result.error, 'error');\n      document.getElementById('import-result').innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"result-error\">\n          <h3>❌ 导入失败</h3>\n          <p>${result.error}</p>\n        </div>\n      `;\n      document.getElementById('import-result').style.display = 'block';\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    showToast('导入失败：' + error.message, 'error');\n  } finally {\n    document.getElementById('import-progress').style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('import-btn').disabled = false;\n  }\n}\n\n// Add import view to window exports\nwindow.onFileSelected = onFileSelected;\nwindow.importAPKG = importAPKG;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179140380}}
{"type":"message","id":"28c4b2bd","parentId":"99f6ed93","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:14.586Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me check the styles.css file to understand the current styling situation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cbe9e1ed75244d669908eba5","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/styles.css"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":30699,"output":74,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30773,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179140383}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d7d3821","parentId":"28c4b2bd","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:14.594Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_cbe9e1ed75244d669908eba5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/* FSRS Memory Web UI - Styles with Theme Support */\n\n/* CSS Variables - Light Theme */\n:root {\n  --primary: #6366f1;\n  --primary-dark: #4f46e5;\n  --primary-light: #818cf8;\n  --secondary: #64748b;\n  --success: #22c55e;\n  --warning: #f59e0b;\n  --danger: #ef4444;\n  \n  /* Light theme colors */\n  --bg-body: #f8fafc;\n  --bg-dark: #ffffff;\n  --bg-card: #ffffff;\n  --bg-hover: #f1f5f9;\n  --text-primary: #0f172a;\n  --text-secondary: #475569;\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n  --border: #e2e8f0;\n  --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n  \n  --radius: 12px;\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Dark Theme */\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --bg-body: #0f172a;\n  --bg-dark: #0f172a;\n  --bg-card: #1e293b;\n  --bg-hover: #334155;\n  --text-primary: #f8fafc;\n  --text-secondary: #94a3b8;\n  --text-muted: #64748b;\n  --border: #334155;\n  --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Reset & Base */\n* {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg-body);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* App Layout */\n#app {\n  display: flex;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n/* Sidebar */\n.sidebar {\n  width: 260px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  position: fixed;\n  height: 100vh;\n  z-index: 100;\n  transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  padding: 24px 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.logo-icon {\n  font-size: 28px;\n}\n\n.logo-text {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-light), var(--primary));\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n/* Theme Toggle */\n.theme-toggle {\n  padding: 16px 20px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.theme-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.theme-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n/* Deck Selector */\n.deck-selector {\n  padding: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.deck-selector-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.deck-select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.deck-select:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.nav-menu {\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.nav-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.nav-item:hover {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.nav-item.active {\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.nav-icon {\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.badge {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  background: var(--danger);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.nav-item.active .badge {\n  background: white;\n  color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.sidebar-stats {\n  padding: 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.sidebar-stats .stat-item {\n  flex: 1;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.stat-value {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--primary-light);\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* Main Content */\n.main-content {\n  flex: 1;\n  margin-left: 260px;\n  padding: 32px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* Views */\n.view {\n  display: none;\n  animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.view.active {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.view-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.view-header h1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* Study View */\n.study-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n\n.study-header h1 {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.study-progress {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.deck-info {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.empty-state {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 80px 40px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.empty-icon {\n  font-size: 64px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.empty-state h2 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.empty-state p {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n/* Card Area */\n.card-area {\n  max-width: 700px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;\n}\n\n.card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 16px 20px;\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .card-header {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n\n.card-id {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.card-state {\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.card-state.new { background: #3498db; color: white; }\n.card-state.learning { background: #f39c12; color: white; }\n.card-state.review { background: #27ae60; color: white; }\n.card-state.relearning { background: #e74c3c; color: white; }\n\n.card-content {\n  padding: 40px;\n  min-height: 200px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.card-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.card-text {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  text-align: center;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n}\n\n.card-footer {\n  padding: 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Rating Buttons */\n.rating-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.rating-btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.rating-btn:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.rating-label {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.rating-interval {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n}\n\n.rating-again { background: #ef4444; }\n.rating-hard { background: #f59e0b; }\n.rating-good { background: #22c55e; }\n.rating-easy { background: #3b82f6; }\n.rating-perfect { background: #8b5cf6; }\n\n/* Buttons */\n.btn {\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background: var(--primary-dark);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n}\n\n.btn-danger {\n  background: var(--danger);\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-hint {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  padding: 10px 32px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.btn-hint:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.btn-large {\n  padding: 16px 48px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.btn-small {\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n/* Search Box */\n.search-box {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.search-box input {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  width: 300px;\n}\n\n.search-box input:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n/* Cards List */\n.cards-list {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.card-item {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.card-item:hover {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n}\n\n.card-item-content {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.card-item-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.card-item-id {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.card-item-deck {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.card-item-state {\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.card-item-question {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n\n.card-item-answer {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}\n\n.card-item-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.card-item-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-icon {\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.btn-icon:hover {\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.btn-icon.danger:hover {\n  background: var(--danger);\n  border-color: var(--danger);\n  color: white;\n}\n\n/* Add Form */\n.add-form {\n  max-width: 600px;\n}\n\n.form-group {\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.form-group label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.form-group textarea,\n.form-group input,\n.form-group select {\n  width: 100%;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: var(--text-primary);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  resize: vertical;\n  font-family: inherit;\n}\n\n.form-group textarea:focus,\n.form-group input:focus,\n.form-group select:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.quick-add {\n  margin-top: 40px;\n  padding-top: 40px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.quick-add h3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Decks View */\n.decks-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.deck-card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 24px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.deck-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n\n.deck-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.deck-card-name {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.deck-card-default {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.deck-card-desc {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.deck-card-stats {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 24px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.deck-stat {\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.deck-stat-value {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--primary-light);\n}\n\n.deck-stat-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.deck-card-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Stats */\n.stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n\n.stat-card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.stat-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n}\n\n.stat-card .stat-icon {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.stat-card .stat-number {\n  font-size: 40px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--primary-light);\n}\n\n.stat-card.stat-due .stat-number {\n  color: var(--warning);\n}\n\n.stat-card.stat-done .stat-number {\n  color: var(--success);\n}\n\n.stat-card .stat-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.stats-chart {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 32px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.stats-chart h3 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.progress-bar {\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n}\n\n.progress-segment {\n  height: 100%;\n  transition: width 0.5s ease;\n}\n\n.progress-legend {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 24px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.legend-dot {\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 12px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  margin-right: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Modal */\n.modal {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.modal-content {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 32px;\n  max-width: 500px;\n  width: 90%;\n}\n\n.modal-content h3 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.modal-content p {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.modal-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n/* Toast */\n.toast {\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 32px;\n  right: 32px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 16px 24px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  transform: translateY(100px);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  z-index: 1001;\n}\n\n.toast.show {\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.toast.success {\n  border-color: var(--success);\n}\n\n.toast.error {\n  border-color: var(--danger);\n}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n  .sidebar {\n    width: 80px;\n  }\n  \n  .logo-text,\n  .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon):not(.badge),\n  .stat-label,\n  .theme-toggle,\n  .deck-selector {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  \n  .nav-item {\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n  \n  .badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 4px;\n    right: 4px;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  \n  .main-content {\n    margin-left: 80px;\n  }\n  \n  .stats-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .sidebar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  \n  .main-content {\n    margin-left: 0;\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  \n  .rating-buttons {\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  \n  .rating-btn {\n    min-width: calc(50% - 6px);\n  }\n  \n  .stats-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ==================== Import View ==================== */\n\n.import-form {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.import-description {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);\n}\n\n.import-description p {\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.import-description ul {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 20px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.import-description li {\n  margin: 4px 0;\n}\n\n.file-label {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 2px dashed var(--border);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.file-label:hover {\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n  background: var(--primary-bg);\n}\n\n.file-icon {\n  font-size: 32px;\n}\n\n.file-text {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.file-info {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.file-info span:first-child {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.file-info span:last-child {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.preview-area {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.preview-area h3 {\n  margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.preview-stats {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.preview-stat {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.preview-stat-value {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.preview-stat-label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.preview-details {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n}\n\n.preview-list h4 {\n  margin: 12px 0 8px 0;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.preview-list ul {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 20px;\n}\n\n.preview-list li {\n  margin: 4px 0;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.import-progress {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.import-progress .progress-bar {\n  height: 8px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.import-progress .progress-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));\n  width: 0%;\n  transition: width 0.3s;\n  animation: pulse 1s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.7; }\n}\n\n.import-progress p {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.import-result {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.result-success {\n  background: var(--success-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--success);\n}\n\n.result-success h3 {\n  color: var(--success);\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\n.result-success p {\n  margin: 8px 0;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.result-error {\n  background: var(--danger-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--danger);\n}\n\n.result-error h3 {\n  color: var(--danger);\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\n.result-error p {\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .preview-stats {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179154591}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6e3d2e1","parentId":"6d7d3821","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:17.931Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the current state. The project has:\n1. Phase 1 (APKG import) completed\n2. Phase 2 UI refactoring at 40% - index-v2.html exists with Tailwind CSS but is incomplete\n3. The original index.html has all views but uses custom CSS\n4. app.js has most functionality but needs to be integrated with the new UI\n\nLet me check if there's a server.js file to understand the backend API structure.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_94574448c0564701bbbf3cda","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/server.js","limit":150}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":37980,"output":263,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38243,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179154594}}
{"type":"message","id":"cfda0188","parentId":"d6e3d2e1","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:17.942Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_94574448c0564701bbbf3cda","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// server.js - Express Backend for FSRS Web UI with Multi-deck & Theme support\nconst express = require('express');\nconst cors = require('cors');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst Database = require('better-sqlite3');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3001;\n\n// Middleware\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, 'public')));\n\n// Database setup - connect to existing cards.db\nconst DB_PATH = process.env.DB_PATH || path.join(__dirname, '..', 'data', 'cards.db');\nconst db = new Database(DB_PATH);\n\n// Import FSRS engine\nconst FSRSEngine = require('../src/fsrs');\n\n// ==================== Database Helper Functions ====================\n\n// Fix inconsistent state values in database\nfunction fixCardStates() {\n  try {\n    // Fix \"2.0\" state to \"review\" (this was a bug where State.Review = 2 was stored as string)\n    const result = db.prepare(\"UPDATE cards SET state = 'review' WHERE state = '2.0'\").run();\n    if (result.changes > 0) {\n      console.log(`Fixed ${result.changes} cards with invalid state '2.0'`);\n    }\n    \n    // Fix empty or null states to \"new\"\n    db.prepare(\"UPDATE cards SET state = 'new' WHERE state IS NULL OR state = ''\").run();\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Error fixing card states:', error);\n  }\n}\n\n// Run state fix on startup\nfixCardStates();\n\n// Get current local time for database queries\nfunction getLocalNow() {\n  return new Date().toISOString();\n}\n\n// ==================== Settings API ====================\n\n// Get theme\napp.get('/api/settings/theme', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const theme = db.prepare(\"SELECT value FROM settings WHERE key = 'theme'\").get();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: theme ? theme.value : 'light' });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Set theme\napp.post('/api/settings/theme', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { theme } = req.body;\n    if (!theme || !['light', 'dark'].includes(theme)) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Invalid theme' });\n    }\n    db.prepare(`\n      INSERT INTO settings (key, value) VALUES ('theme', ?)\n      ON CONFLICT(key) DO UPDATE SET value = excluded.value\n    `).run(theme);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: theme });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// ==================== Deck API ====================\n\n// Get all decks\napp.get('/api/decks', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    // Use localtime for due_date comparison to match user timezone\n    const decks = db.prepare(`\n      SELECT d.*, \n        (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cards WHERE deck_id = d.id) as card_count,\n        (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cards WHERE deck_id = d.id AND strftime('%s', due_date) <= strftime('%s', 'now')) as due_count\n      FROM decks d \n      ORDER BY d.id ASC\n    `).all();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: decks });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get single deck\napp.get('/api/decks/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const deck = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM decks WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!deck) {\n      return res.status(404).json({ success: false, error: 'Deck not found' });\n    }\n    res.json({ success: true, data: deck });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Create deck\napp.post('/api/decks', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { name, description } = req.body;\n    if (!name) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Deck name required' });\n    }\n    \n    const stmt = db.prepare('INSERT INTO decks (name, description) VALUES (?, ?)');\n    const result = stmt.run(name, description || '');\n    \n    const newDeck = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM decks WHERE id = ?').get(result.lastInsertRowid);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: newDeck });\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error.message.includes('UNIQUE')) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Deck name already exists' });\n    }\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Update deck\napp.put('/api/decks/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { name, description } = req.body;\n    const deckId = parseInt(req.params.id);\n    \n    if (deckId === 1) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Cannot modify default deck' });\n    }\n    \n    db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE decks SET name = ?, description = ?, updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE id = ?\n    `).run(name, description || '', deckId);\n    \n    const updatedDeck = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM decks WHERE id = ?').get(deckId);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: updatedDeck });\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error.message.includes('UNIQUE')) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Deck name already exists' });\n    }\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n\n[393 more lines in file. Use offset=151 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179157939}}
{"type":"message","id":"759c705f","parentId":"cfda0188","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:21.984Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the project state. Let me create a comprehensive plan and start the Phase 2 UI refactoring work using the team-task approach. I need to:\n\n1. Merge index-v2.html (Tailwind CSS) with the complete views from index.html\n2. Update app.js to work with the new UI structure\n3. Add keyboard shortcuts\n4. Add responsive design\n5. Ensure theme switching works\n\nLet me start by creating a task plan and then delegating to the appropriate agents. First, let me check if there's a team-task skill available.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the current state. The project has:\n- ✅ Phase 1 (APKG import) complete\n- 🔄 Phase 2 at 40% - index-v2.html has Tailwind CSS but incomplete views\n- The original index.html has all views but uses custom CSS\n- app.js has full functionality but needs integration with the new UI\n\nLet me start the Phase 2 completion by creating a comprehensive implementation plan and delegating to the team.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_90fe8bc537cc40b3a9a43f85","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":39580,"output":383,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39963,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179157942}}
{"type":"message","id":"26467061","parentId":"759c705f","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:59:21.993Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_90fe8bc537cc40b3a9a43f85","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fsrs-memory\ndescription: FSRS 间隔重复记忆系统 - 真正实时 Discord 提醒\nversion: \"3.0.0\"\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      bins:\n        - node\n      packages:\n        - fsrs.js\n        - better-sqlite3\nenv:\n  - name: DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL\n    description: Discord Webhook URL (必填)\n  - name: DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID\n    description: Discord 频道 ID (默认: 1475722914904014958)\n  - name: CHECK_INTERVAL\n    description: 检查间隔毫秒数 (默认: 30000 = 30秒)\n  - name: REMINDER_COOLDOWN\n    description: 同一卡片提醒冷却时间 (默认: 86400000 = 24小时)\n  - name: VERBOSE\n    description: 详细日志 (默认: false)\nfiles:\n  read:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n  write:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n---\n\n# FSRS Memory - 间隔重复记忆系统 v3.0 (实时版)\n\n## ✨ 核心特性\n\n- **真正实时**：默认 30 秒检查一次，秒级触发提醒\n- **即时发送**：检测到到期卡片后立即通过 Discord Webhook 发送\n- **防骚扰**：同一卡片 24 小时内只提醒一次\n- **FSRS 优化**：新卡片首次复习可能只需要几分钟\n\n## 架构\n\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── SKILL.md              # 本文档\n├── README.md             # 使用说明\n├── .env.example          # 配置示例\n├── handler.js            # Discord 消息处理（交互命令）\n├── service.js            # 服务实时提醒守护进程（）\n├── package.json          # 依赖管理\n├── src/\n│   ├── storage.js        # SQLite 存储\n│   ├── fsrs.js           # FSRS 算法封装\n│   └── scheduler.js      # 复习调度器\n└── data/\n    ├── cards.db          # 卡片数据库\n    └── reminder-state.json  # 提醒状态\n```\n\n## 配置步骤\n\n### 1. 获取 Discord Webhook URL\n\n1. 进入 Discord 服务器设置\n2. 选择 **整合** → **Webhooks**\n3. 点击 **新建 Webhook**\n4. 填写名称，选择频道\n5. 点击 **复制 Webhook URL**\n\n### 2. 配置环境变量\n\n```bash\n# 复制配置示例\ncp .env.example .env\n\n# 编辑 .env 文件\nnano .env\n\n# 填入你的 Webhook URL:\n# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/xxx/xxx\n```\n\n### 3. 启动服务\n\n```bash\n# 开发测试\nnode service.js\n\n# 后台运行\nnohup node service.js > fsrs.log 2>&1 &\n\n# 使用 PM2 (推荐)\npm2 start service.js --name fsrs\npm2 logs fsrs\n```\n\n## 工作流程\n\n### 实时提醒模式 (service.js)\n\n```\n用户添加卡片\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│  SQLite 存储   │\n│  (due_date)    │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     │ 每 30 秒\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│ service.js      │────▶│ 检查到期卡片    │\n│ (长期运行守护)  │     │ due_date <= now │\n└─────────────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n                     ┌──────────────────┐\n                     │ 冷却时间检查    │\n                     │ (24小时内不重复) │\n                     └──────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n                     ┌──────────────────┐\n                     │ Discord Webhook  │\n                     │ 即时发送提醒     │\n                     └──────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 交互命令模式 (handler.js)\n\n```\n用户发送消息\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ handler.js      │\n│ (消息事件触发)  │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ 解析命令/卡片  │\n├─────────────────┤\n│ • 添加 问答    │\n│ • 列表         │\n│ • 统计         │\n│ • 复习         │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ 执行并返回结果 │\n└─────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 环境变量\n\n| 变量 | 默认值 | 说明 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | (必填) | Discord Webhook URL |\n| `DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID` | 1475722914904014958 | 频道 ID |\n| `CHECK_INTERVAL` | 30000 | 检查间隔 (毫秒) |\n| `REMINDER_COOLDOWN` | 86400000 | 冷却时间 (毫秒) |\n| `VERBOSE` | false | 详细日志 |\n| `ENABLE_HEALTH_CHECK` | false | 启用健康检查 |\n| `HEALTH_CHECK_PORT` | 3000 | 健康检查端口 |\n\n## 为什么 30 秒间隔？\n\nFSRS 算法的特点：\n- 新卡片首次复习间隔可能是 **几分钟到几小时**\n- 如果间隔太长，会错过最佳复习时机\n- 30 秒平衡了及时性和系统开销\n\n## 在 OpenClaw 中运行\n\n```bash\n# 方式 1: 直接运行\nopenclaw exec -- workdir=/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsfs-memory node service.js\n\n# 方式 2: 后台运行\nopenclaw exec --background -- workdir=/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory node service.js\n```\n\n## 健康检查\n\n启用后可访问 `http://localhost:3000/health` 查看服务状态：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"dueCards\": 3,\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772179161990}}
