{"type":"message","id":"9d0969e4","parentId":"eb213e8d","timestamp":"2026-02-27T08:01:02.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no team-task skill available. Let me proceed with the Phase 2 UI refactoring work directly by coordinating the tasks myself. I'll create a comprehensive plan and execute it step by step.\n\nBased on my analysis:\n1. index-v2.html has the modern Tailwind CSS UI but is incomplete (only has study view)\n2. index.html has all views but uses custom CSS\n3. app.js has all the functionality\n\nThe best approach is to:\n1. Complete index-v2.html by migrating all views from index.html\n2. Update app.js to work with the new Tailwind-based UI\n3. Ensure all features work (keyboard shortcuts, theme switching, responsive design)\n\nLet me create the complete index-v2.html with all views migrated.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll proceed with the Phase 2 UI refactoring work directly. Based on my analysis, I need to:\n\n1. Complete the index-v2.html with all views migrated\n2. Update app.js to work with the new UI structure  \n3. Ensure keyboard shortcuts, responsive design, and theme switching work\n\nLet me start by creating the complete modernized UI:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2206f4de601b4ef5a13a2f22","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/index-v2.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>FSRS Memory - 智能记忆卡片</title>\n  \n  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Phosphor Icons -->\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Custom Config -->\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      darkMode: 'class',\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          colors: {\n            primary: {\n              50: '#eff6ff',\n              100: '#dbeafe',\n              200: '#bfdbfe',\n              300: '#93c5fd',\n              400: '#60a5fa',\n              500: '#3b82f6',\n              600: '#2563eb',\n              700: '#1d4ed8',\n              800: '#1e40af',\n              900: '#1e3a8a',\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  \n  <style>\n    /* Custom styles that Tailwind can't handle */\n    .card-flip {\n      perspective: 1000px;\n    }\n    .card-inner {\n      transition: transform 0.6s;\n      transform-style: preserve-3d;\n    }\n    .card-flipped .card-inner {\n      transform: rotateY(180deg);\n    }\n    .card-front, .card-back {\n      backface-visibility: hidden;\n    }\n    .card-back {\n      transform: rotateY(180deg);\n    }\n    \n    /* Smooth transitions */\n    .fade-in {\n      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in;\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n    \n    /* Custom scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #475569;\n    }\n\n    /* Mobile menu */\n    .mobile-menu {\n      display: none;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .sidebar {\n        transform: translateX(-100%);\n        position: fixed;\n        z-index: 50;\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n      }\n      .sidebar.open {\n        transform: translateX(0);\n      }\n      .mobile-menu {\n        display: flex;\n      }\n      .main-content {\n        margin-left: 0 !important;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200\">\n  <div id=\"app\" class=\"flex h-screen overflow-hidden\">\n    \n    <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->\n    <button class=\"mobile-menu fixed top-4 left-4 z-50 p-2 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\" onclick=\"toggleMobileMenu()\">\n      <i class=\"ph ph-list text-2xl\"></i>\n    </button>\n    \n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"sidebar w-64 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-r border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 flex flex-col transition-all duration-300\">\n      <!-- Logo -->\n      <div class=\"p-6 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-brain text-3xl text-primary-600\"></i>\n          <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">FSRS Memory</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Navigation -->\n      <nav class=\"flex-1 p-4 space-y-1 overflow-y-auto\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"study\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-book-open text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>学习</span>\n          <span class=\"ml-auto badge bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900 text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\" id=\"due-badge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"cards\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-cards text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>卡片</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"decks\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-folder-open text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>牌组</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"add\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-plus-circle text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>添加</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"import\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-download-simple text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>导入</span>\n        </button>\n        \n        <button class=\"nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\" data-view=\"stats\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-chart-bar text-xl\"></i>\n          <span>统计</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n      \n      <!-- Stats Summary -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\">\n          <div class=\"text-center p-2 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"total-cards\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">总卡片</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-center p-2 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-orange-600\" id=\"due-cards\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">待复习</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Theme Toggle -->\n      <div class=\"p-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <button id=\"theme-toggle-btn\" onclick=\"toggleTheme()\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors\">\n          <i class=\"ph ph-moon text-lg\" id=\"theme-icon\"></i>\n          <span id=\"theme-text\">暗色模式</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n    \n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"main-content flex-1 overflow-y-auto ml-64 transition-all duration-300\">\n      <!-- Top Bar -->\n      <header class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-6 py-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\" id=\"page-title\">今日学习</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1\" id=\"page-subtitle\">开始你的复习之旅</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <select id=\"deck-select\" onchange=\"changeDeck(this.value)\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\">\n              <option value=\"\">全部牌组</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n      \n      <!-- Content Views -->\n      <div class=\"p-6\">\n        \n        <!-- Study View -->\n        <section id=\"study-view\" class=\"view active fade-in\">\n          <div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n            <!-- Progress -->\n            <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">\n                进度：<span id=\"study-progress\" class=\"font-medium\">0 / 0</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded\">快捷键：1-5</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Card Area -->\n            <div class=\"card-flip mb-6\" id=\"card-flip-area\">\n              <div class=\"card-inner relative bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 min-h-[400px] cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"toggleCardFlip()\">\n                <!-- Front -->\n                <div class=\"card-front absolute inset-0 p-8 flex flex-col\">\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center\">\n                      <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">问题</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium\" id=\"question-text\">加载中...</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <button class=\"px-6 py-2 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); showAnswer()\">\n                      显示答案\n                    </button>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Back -->\n                <div class=\"card-back absolute inset-0 p-8 flex flex-col\">\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center\">\n                      <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">答案</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium\" id=\"answer-text\">加载中...</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Rating Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2\" id=\"rating-buttons\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(1)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">Again</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-1\">1m</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900 hover:bg-orange-50 dark:hover:bg-orange-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(2)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Hard</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-2\">10m</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(3)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">Good</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-3\">1d</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-green-200 dark:border-green-900 hover:bg-green-50 dark:hover:bg-green-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(4)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">Easy</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-4\">4d</div>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-900 hover:bg-purple-50 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/30 transition-colors\" onclick=\"rateCard(5)\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400\">Perfect</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\" id=\"interval-5\">10d</div>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Empty State -->\n            <div class=\"empty-state text-center py-16\" id=\"no-cards-message\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <i class=\"ph ph-check-circle text-6xl text-green-500 mb-4\"></i>\n              <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">太棒了！</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6\">今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n              <button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">\n                添加新卡片\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n        \n        <!-- Cards List View -->\n        <section id=\"cards-view\" class=\"view fade-in\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div class=\"view-header flex justify-between items-center mb-6\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">所有卡片</h1>\n            <div class=\"search-box\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"card-search\" placeholder=\"搜索卡片...\" oninput=\"filterCards()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 w-64\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"cards-list space-y-3\" id=\"cards-list\">\n            <!-- Cards will be loaded here -->\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Decks View -->\n        <section id=\"decks-view\" class=\"view fade-in\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div class=\"view-header flex justify-between items-center mb-6\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">牌组管理</h1>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary px-4 py-2 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"showCreateDeckModal()\">\n              <i class=\"ph ph-plus mr-2\"></i>新建牌组\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"decks-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\" id=\"decks-grid\">\n            <!-- Decks will be loaded here -->\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Add Card View -->\n        <section id=\"add-view\" class=\"view fade-in\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div class=\"view-header mb-6\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">添加卡片</h1>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"add-form max-w-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n              <label for=\"deck-select-add\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">选择牌组</label>\n              <select id=\"deck-select-add\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\">\n                <!-- Options populated by JS -->\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n              <label for=\"question-input\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">问题</label>\n              <textarea id=\"question-input\" placeholder=\"输入问题...\" rows=\"3\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n              <label for=\"answer-input\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">答案</label>\n              <textarea id=\"answer-input\" placeholder=\"输入答案...\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            \n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"addCard()\">添加卡片</button>\n            \n            <div class=\"quick-add mt-10 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium mb-4\">快速添加 (格式：问题::答案)</h3>\n              <textarea id=\"quick-add-input\" placeholder=\"每行一个卡片，格式：问题::答案\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 mb-4\"></textarea>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-secondary px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"quickAdd()\">批量添加</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Import APKG View -->\n        <section id=\"import-view\" class=\"view fade-in\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div class=\"view-header mb-6\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">导入 ANKI 卡包</h1>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"import-form max-w-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"import-description bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 mb-6 border-l-4 border-primary-600\">\n              <p class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">📦 导入 .apkg 格式的 Anki 卡包文件</p>\n              <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-1\">\n                <li>支持所有标准 .apkg 文件</li>\n                <li>自动保留卡片内容和字段</li>\n                <li>可选择导入到指定牌组</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n              <label for=\"import-deck-select\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">导入到牌组</label>\n              <select id=\"import-deck-select\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\">\n                <option value=\"1\">默认牌组</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n              <label for=\"apkg-file\" class=\"file-label flex items-center gap-3 p-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:border-primary-500 transition-colors\">\n                <i class=\"ph ph-folder text-3xl\"></i>\n                <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">选择 .apkg 文件</span>\n              </label>\n              <input type=\"file\" id=\"apkg-file\" accept=\".apkg\" style=\"display: none;\" onchange=\"onFileSelected()\">\n              <div id=\"file-info\" class=\"file-info mt-3 p-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg flex gap-4 text-sm\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                <span id=\"file-name\" class=\"font-medium\"></span>\n                <span id=\"file-size\" class=\"text-gray-500\"></span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div id=\"preview-area\" class=\"preview-area mt-6 p-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4\">📋 卡包预览</h3>\n              <div class=\"preview-stats grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"preview-stat text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-value text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"preview-cards\">0</span>\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-label text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 block mt-1\">卡片数</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-stat text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-value text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"preview-decks\">0</span>\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-label text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 block mt-1\">牌组数</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"preview-stat text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg\">\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-value text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"preview-models\">0</span>\n                  <span class=\"preview-stat-label text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 block mt-1\">模型数</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"preview-details\" class=\"preview-details mt-4\"></div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large w-full px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" id=\"import-btn\" onclick=\"importAPKG()\" disabled>\n              📥 开始导入\n            </button>\n            \n            <div id=\"import-progress\" class=\"import-progress mt-6\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <div class=\"progress-bar h-2 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-3\">\n                <div class=\"progress-fill h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-primary-400 w-0 transition-all duration-300\" id=\"progress-fill\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm\" id=\"progress-text\">正在导入...</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div id=\"import-result\" class=\"import-result mt-6 p-6 rounded-lg text-center\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Stats View -->\n        <section id=\"stats-view\" class=\"view fade-in\" style=\"display: none;\">\n          <div class=\"view-header mb-6\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">学习统计</h1>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"stats-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10\">\n            <div class=\"stat-card bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">📚</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600\" id=\"stat-total\">0</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">总卡片数</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-card stat-due bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">⏰</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-orange-600\" id=\"stat-due\">0</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">待复习</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-card stat-done bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">✅</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-green-600\" id=\"stat-reviewed\">0</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">已复习</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-card bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">🆕</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600\" id=\"stat-new\">0</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">新卡片</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-card bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">📈</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-600\" id=\"stat-learning\">0</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">学习中</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-card bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n              <div class=\"stat-icon text-4xl mb-3\">🎯</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-number text-4xl font-bold text-purple-600\" id=\"stat-ease\">2.5</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-title text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">平均难度</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"stats-chart bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-6\">学习进度</h3>\n            <div class=\"progress-bar h-8 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700\">\n              <div class=\"progress-segment h-full bg-blue-500 transition-all duration-500\" id=\"progress-new\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n              <div class=\"progress-segment h-full bg-yellow-500 transition-all duration-500\" id=\"progress-learning\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n              <div class=\"progress-segment h-full bg-green-500 transition-all duration-500\" id=\"progress-review\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"progress-legend flex justify-center gap-6 mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n              <span class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"legend-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mr-2\"></span> 新卡片</span>\n              <span class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"legend-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 mr-2\"></span> 学习</span>\n              <span class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"legend-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500 mr-2\"></span> 复习</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n        \n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Delete Confirmation Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 flex items-center justify-center z-50\" id=\"delete-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-md w-full mx-4\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">确认删除</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6\">确定要删除这张卡片吗？此操作无法撤销。</p>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions flex gap-3 justify-end\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-danger px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" id=\"confirm-delete-btn\">删除</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Deck Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 flex items-center justify-center z-50\" id=\"deck-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-md w-full mx-4\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\" id=\"deck-modal-title\">新建牌组</h3>\n      <div class=\"form-group mb-4\">\n        <label for=\"deck-name-input\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">牌组名称</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"deck-name-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组名称...\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group mb-6\">\n        <label for=\"deck-desc-input\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">描述（可选）</label>\n        <textarea id=\"deck-desc-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组描述...\" rows=\"2\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions flex gap-3 justify-end\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\" onclick=\"closeDeckModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary px-4 py-2 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" id=\"save-deck-btn\">保存</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Toast Notification -->\n  <div class=\"toast fixed bottom-6 right-6 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-lg transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 z-50 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\" id=\"toast\"></div>\n\n  <script src=\"app-v2.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":41457,"output":8819,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50276,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772179163844}}
